  "content": "\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">目前，需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>（或使用类似 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Fabulously Optimized 整合包</a> 的替代方案）才能体验 Barely Default 的全部功能*</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f15c74aaa6772fdcf0482c6bab7d9614b203940b_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"861\" height=\"294\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>让 Minecraft 更加 Minecraft</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">小时候，《我的世界》的更新就像圣诞节一样令人期待！但有时候它们来得有点慢……</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">《故事模式》和《地牢》发布时，我深深着迷于其中的新设定！然而这些内容从未真正进入原版游戏……</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqqLxtn983g?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">与其等待更新，我决定自己动手来弥合这些空白。Barely Default 串联起整个《我的世界》的正史内容，同时忠实于原版美术风格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">现代外观：我已更新了“被遗漏”的纹理，使其与 Mojang 目前更精细的美术风格保持一致。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">最终呈现的是一个既焕然一新又内容丰富、却依然令人熟悉的世界。我希望你能在这个整合包中游玩多年，依然能不断发现新的内容！</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">按名称区分的变体！</h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接查看 Barely Default 中所有命名变体的完整列表</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/s0q08ghzmtde1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5863\" height=\"5942\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">同时也欢迎查看 CYKLOPPS 和我共同制作的官方&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fbarely-default-data-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Barely Default 数据包</a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">更多酷炫功能！</h1>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/i9FjExcZ57Y?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WQ73j2drgjE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Th6UydWl_pM?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wtDQX262DZo?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d4SU-ZELQAE?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=8&t=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OI9APvuQJK4?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IUatvyvlSZU?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
